---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ToolIcon from '../components/ToolIcon.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | ToolsLibrary"
  description="Terms and Conditions of Use for ToolsLibrary. Understand your rights and responsibilities when using our free client-side image editing and developer tools."
  canonicalUrl="https://fasttoolverse.com/terms"
>
  <div class="relative py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/40 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400">
        <ToolIcon name="file-text" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        <span>Legal Terms & User Agreement</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono">
        Last revised: September 2026 &bull; Effective immediately
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Terms Summary -->
    <div class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/80 space-y-2.5">
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <ToolIcon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" />
        <span>Summary for Creators & Developers</span>
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        ToolsLibrary is 100% free to use. You retain complete, unrestricted ownership over all images, code, and content processed through our tools. Because processing is executed inside your browser without backend storage, you are responsible for maintaining copies of your files.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- 1. Agreement to Terms -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          1. Acceptance of Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using the website at <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">toolslibrary.com</a> ("ToolsLibrary", the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms") and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Description of Service -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          2. Description of the Service
        </h2>
        <p>
          ToolsLibrary provides browser-based utilities including, but not limited to, image resizing, dimension scaling, image compression, format conversion, code formatting, cryptographic hashing, and developer helpers. The Service is provided free of charge, with no mandatory subscription or registration required.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Intellectual Property Rights & Ownership -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          3. Intellectual Property & Your Content Ownership
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p>
            <strong>Your Content:</strong> You retain 100% ownership, copyright, and all associated rights to any images, graphics, text, or data that you load, convert, or export through the Service. ToolsLibrary claims zero ownership, license, or rights to your processed files.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Our Proprietary Rights:</strong> The ToolsLibrary name, branding, logos, website layout, algorithms, scripts, design components, and source code are protected by intellectual property, copyright, and trademark laws. You may not duplicate, reverse engineer, or redistribute our proprietary software without prior written permission.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Fair Usage & Prohibited Activities -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          4. Acceptable & Fair Usage
        </h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use ToolsLibrary only for lawful purposes. You agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Use automated scripts, bots, or scrapers that cause excessive burden or degradation of the Service.</li>
          <li>Attempt to bypass security measures, disrupt infrastructure, or introduce malicious payloads.</li>
          <li>Use the platform to process, generate, or distribute illegal, abusive, infringing, or harmful materials.</li>
          <li>Frame or embed ToolsLibrary within an unauthorized third-party site without proper attribution.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. Disclaimer of Warranties -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          5. Disclaimer of Warranties ("As-Is")
        </h2>
        <p>
          The materials and tools on ToolsLibrary are provided on an <strong>"as is"</strong> and <strong>"as available"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, ToolsLibrary disclaims all warranties, including without limitation warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not guarantee that the Service will always be error-free, uninterrupted, secure, or that conversion algorithms will meet specific technical requirements for every file format or operating system.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. Limitation of Liability -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          6. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall ToolsLibrary, its operators, contributors, or affiliates be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages (including, without limitation, loss of data, loss of business revenue, or computer malfunction) arising out of or in connection with your use or inability to use the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 7. External Links & Third-Party Advertisements -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          7. Advertisements & External Links
        </h2>
        <p>
          The Service may display advertisements served by third-party advertising networks (such as Google AdSense) or contain links to third-party web pages. We do not endorse, guarantee, or assume responsibility for any products, services, or content offered by third parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 8. Changes to Terms -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          8. Modifications to Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to revise or update these Terms of Service at any time without prior notice. Continued use of the website following any changes signifies your binding agreement to the revised Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 9. Contact -->
      <section class="space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          9. Inquiries & Legal Notices
        </h2>
        <p>
          For questions regarding these Terms or legal matters, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/80 inline-block font-mono text-sm">
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@toolslibrary.com" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">support@toolslibrary.com</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
